\nCompany_age_points = LOOKUP((current_year - yearFounded), {\n"10+ years": 12,\n"5-10 years": 9,\n"3-5 years": 6,\n"1-3 years": 3,\n"< 1 year": 0\n})\nFinancial_health_points = LOOKUP(financialStatus, {\n"profitable_3_years": 10,\n"profitable_1_year": 7,\n"break_even": 5,\n"funded_runway_2_years": 4,\n"funded_runway_1_year": 2,\n"uncertain": 0\n})\nCustomer_retention_points = IF customer_retention_rate >= 0:\nLOOKUP(customer_retention_rate, {\n">= 95%": 8,\n"90-94%": 6,\n"80-89%": 4,\n"70-79%": 2,\n"< 70%": 0\n})\nELSE: 3 // Default if metric not available\nMaximum Stability Score: 30 points\nCalculation Example:\nHealthcare chatbot vendor stability:\nCompany age:\n- yearFounded = 2018 → (2026 - 2018) = 8 years → 9 points\nFinancial health:\n- financialStatus = "profitable_1_year" → 7 points\nCustomer retention:\n- customer_retention_rate = 93% → 6 points\nStability_Score = 9 + 7 + 6 = 22 points\n1.4.6 Support Score\nFormula:\nSupport_Score = Support_tier_points + Coverage_points + Expertise_points\nSupport_tier_points = LOOKUP(supportTiers, {\n"24_7_phone_chat_email": 10,\n"business_hours_phone_chat": 7,\n"business_hours_email": 4,\n"email_only": 2\n})\nCoverage_points = IF supports_HIPAA_workflows = "yes": 5 ELSE 0\nExpertise_points = LOOKUP(technicalAccountManager, {\n"dedicated_tam": 5,\n"shared_tam": 3,\n"standard_support": 1\n})\nMaximum Support Score: 20 points\nCalculation Example:\nHealthcare chatbot support:\nSupport tier:\n- supportTiers = "24_7_phone_chat_email" (healthcare requires 24/7) → 10 points\nCoverage:\n- supports_HIPAA_workflows = "yes" → 5 points\nExpertise:\n- technicalAccountManager = "dedicated_tam" → 5 points\nSupport_Score = 10 + 5 + 5 = 20 points\n1.4.7 Final Operational Risk\nFormula:\nOperational_Score = SLA + Incident_Management + Deployment_Maturity +	[-0.016759578,0.024745315,0.025588065,0.02990194,-0.012419639,0.04395589,-0.005392357,-0.0012248129,0.03598146,0.056592256,-0.022790441,-0.0031165683,-0.012953268,0.018239595,-0.033002