6558a332-f0f5-416b-b6a4-1df11a6088da	\N	C:\\2026\\AI-Q\\Jul2026\\14July2026_bkp\\AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf	AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf	14	"Medium (Business confidential)": 10,\n"Low (Public or anonymized)": 5\n}) + Compliance_documentation_burden\nCompliance_documentation_burden = IF sector IN ["Healthcare",\n"Financial_Services"]:\nCOUNT(customerRegulatoryRequirements) × 3\nELSE:\nCOUNT(customerRegulatoryRequirements) × 2\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance data sensitivity:\ncustomerDataSensitivity = "High (PHI)" → 20 points\nCompliance documentation:\n- sector = "Healthcare"\n- customerRegulatoryRequirements COUNT = 3\n- Burden = 3 × 3 = 9 points\nData_Sensitivity_Friction = 20 + 9 = 29 points\n2.2.4 Risk Tolerance Friction\nFormula:\nRisk_Tolerance_Friction = LOOKUP(customerRiskTolerance, {\n"Aggressive": 3,\n"Moderate": 8,\n"Conservative": 15,\n"Risk_averse": 20\n}) + Proof_requirement_burden\nProof_requirement_burden = IF customerRiskTolerance IN ["Conservative",\n"Risk_averse"]:\n(customerSpecificRiskCount × 2) + Regulatory_count\nELSE:\ncustomerSpecificRiskCount\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance risk tolerance:\ncustomerRiskTolerance = "Conservative" → 15 points\nProof requirements:\n- customerSpecificRiskCount = 3\n- Regulatory_count = 3\n- Burden = (3 × 2) + 3 = 9 points\nRisk_Tolerance_Friction = 15 + 9 = 24 points\n2.2.5 Customer-Specific Risk Friction\nFormula:\nCustomer_Specific_Risk_Friction = (customerSpecificRiskCount × Risk_weight) +\nUnique_requirement_penalty\nRisk_weight = LOOKUP(customerType, {\n"Enterprise": 12,\n"Mid_market": 10,\n"SMB": 7\n})\nUnique_requirement_penalty = IF customer_has_unique_requirements = "yes":\ncustomerSpecificRiskCount × 5\nELSE: 0\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance specific risks:\ncustomerSpecificRiskCount = 3:\n1. Legacy mainframe claims system integration\n2. State insurance regulation compliance (50 states)\n3. PHI handling audit trail requirements\ncustomerType = "Enterprise" → Risk_weight = 12\nUnique requirements:\n- customer_has_unique_requirements = "yes" (state-by-state compliance\nvariations)\n- Penalty = 3 × 5 = 15 points\nCustomer_Specific_Risk_Friction = (3 × 12) + 15 = 36 + 15 = 51 points\n2.2.6 Total Customer Friction Risk\nFormula:\nCustomer_Friction_Risk = MIN(100, Regulatory + Data_Sensitivity +\nRisk_Tolerance + Specific_Risks)\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance customer friction:\nCFR = MIN(100, 18 + 29 + 24 + 51)\n= MIN(100, 122)\n= 100 (capped at maximum)\nInterpretation: Maximum customer friction\nHealthFirst represents highest-difficulty customer profile:\n- Complex regulatory environment (HIPAA + SOC2 + State regs)\n- High data sensitivity (PHI handling)\n- Conservative risk tolerance\n- Unique state-by-state compliance requirements\n2.3 Implementation Risk Calculation\n2.3.1 Master Formula\nImplementation_Risk = Integration_Complexity +\nCustomization_Required +\nTimeline_Pressure +\nFeature_Gap +\nMitigation_Gap\nIR = MIN(100, sum_of_components)\n2.3.2 Integration Complexity\nFormula:\nIntegration_Complexity = AVERAGE(Integration_point_complexity_scores) +\nSystem_count_penalty\nIntegration_point_complexity = LOOKUP_PER_SYSTEM(system_type, {\n"Legacy_mainframe": 35,\n"Legacy_client_server": 28,\n"Modern_monolith": 20,\n"Microservices": 15,\n"Cloud_native_API": 10,\n"SaaS_standard_connector": 5\n})\nSystem_count_penalty = IF integration_point_count > 3:\n(integration_point_count - 3) × 5\nELSE: 0\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance integrations:\nIntegration points:\n1. Legacy mainframe claims system → 35 points\n2. Salesforce CRM (modern) → 20 points\n3. Azure cloud data lake → 10 points\nAVERAGE = (35 + 20 + 10) / 3 = 21.67\nSystem count:	[-0.030150408,0.0111822495,-0.0012877652,0.025484754,-0.038662836,0.023644818,0.028412111,-0.01931648,0.01665513,0.026627809,-0.021953406,-0.06658269,0.018479258,-0.029120171,-0.038500763,0.009975095,-