e3a1a4a0-d7f1-4e68-b623-56579985b697	\N	C:\\2026\\AI-Q\\Jul2026\\14July2026_bkp\\AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf	AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf	15	Calculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance integrations:\nIntegration points:\n1. Legacy mainframe claims system → 35 points\n2. Salesforce CRM (modern) → 20 points\n3. Azure cloud data lake → 10 points\nAVERAGE = (35 + 20 + 10) / 3 = 21.67\nSystem count:\n- integration_point_count = 3\n- penalty = 0 (not > 3)\nIntegration_Complexity = 21.67 + 0 = 22 points\n2.3.3 Customization Required\nFormula:\nCustomization_Required = Base_customization_effort +\nIndustry_specific_penalty +\nWorkflow_modification_penalty\nBase_customization_effort = LOOKUP(customizationLevel, {\n"None (use as-is)": 0,\n"Minimal (configuration only)": 5,\n"Moderate (config + light dev)": 15,\n"Extensive (significant dev)": 25,\n"Custom_build": 40\n})\nIndustry_specific_penalty = IF customer_requires_industry_workflows = "yes":\nLOOKUP(sector, {\n"Healthcare": 12,\n"Financial_Services": 10,\n"Government": 8,\n"Other": 5\n})\nELSE: 0\nWorkflow_modification_penalty = business_process_changes_required × 3\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance customization:\nBase effort:\n- customizationLevel = "Moderate" (need claims-specific rules) → 15 points\nIndustry penalty:\n- customer_requires_industry_workflows = "yes"\n- sector = "Healthcare" → 12 points\nWorkflow modification:\n- business_process_changes_required = 4 (claims workflow, authorization\nprocess, appeals handling, audit trail)\n- Penalty = 4 × 3 = 12 points\nCustomization_Required = 15 + 12 + 12 = 39 points\n2.3.4 Timeline Pressure\nFormula:\nTimeline_Pressure = Base_timeline_risk + Deadline_criticality_bonus\nBase_timeline_risk = LOOKUP(implementationTimelineMonths, {\n"< 2 months": 30,\n"2-3 months": 20,\n"3-6 months": 10,\n"6-12 months": 5,\n"> 12 months": 2\n})\nDeadline_criticality_bonus = IF regulatory_deadline_exists = "yes":\nMIN(15, months_until_deadline × -3 + 20)\nELSE: 0\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance timeline:\nimplementationTimelineMonths = 4 → 10 points\nDeadline criticality:\n- regulatory_deadline_exists = "yes" (CECL compliance)\n- months_until_deadline = 6\n- Bonus = MIN(15, (6 × -3) + 20) = MIN(15, 2) = 2 points\nTimeline_Pressure = 10 + 2 = 12 points\n2.3.5 Feature Gap\nFormula:\nFeature_Gap = ((100 - productFeatureMatchPct) / 2) + Critical_feature_penalty\nCritical_feature_penalty = COUNT(missing_critical_features) × 8\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance feature analysis:\nproductFeatureMatchPct = 85% (vendor covers 85% of requirements)\nFeature_Gap_base = (100 - 85) / 2 = 7.5 points\nCritical features missing:\n1. Prior authorization integration\n2. State-specific appeals workflow\nCOUNT(missing_critical_features) = 2\nCritical_feature_penalty = 2 × 8 = 16 points\nFeature_Gap = 7.5 + 16 = 23.5 ≈ 24 points\n2.3.6 Mitigation Gap\nFormula:\nMitigation_Gap = ((Required_mitigations - Proposed_mitigations) /\nRequired_mitigations) × Maximum_penalty\nRequired_mitigations = customerSpecificRiskCount × Average_mitigations_per_risk\nAverage_mitigations_per_risk = 4 // From Mitigation Database analysis\nMaximum_penalty = 40\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance mitigation coverage:\ncustomerSpecificRiskCount = 3\nRequired_mitigations = 3 × 4 = 12\nProposed_mitigations = 3:\n- Data encryption at rest and in transit\n- HIPAA-compliant access controls\n- Audit logging\nMitigation_Gap = ((12 - 3) / 12) × 40\n= (9 / 12) × 40\n= 0.75 × 40\n= 30 points\n2.3.7 Total Implementation Risk\nFormula:\nImplementation_Risk = MIN(100, Integration + Customization +\nTimeline + Feature_Gap + Mitigation_Gap)\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance implementation risk:	[-0.013895882,0.0013275432,0.0023162602,-0.011262533,0.03173552,0.02984261,0.08505518,-0.028457938,0.036910504,0.016075421,-0.012034614,-0.04864364,0.012526846,-0.009241007,-0.0008489006,-0.020831194,-0.016