or claims)\n- Penalty = 0\nTechnical_Integration_Complexity = 25.1 + 0 + 0 = 25.1 ≈ 25 points\n3.4.3 Feature Gap Risk\nFormula:\nFeature_Gap_Risk = Critical_feature_gap + Non_critical_feature_gap +\nWorkaround_complexity\nCritical_feature_gap = COUNT(missing_critical_features) × Critical_weight\nCritical_weight = 15\nNon_critical_feature_gap = ((100 - Feature_match_percentage) / 2)\nWorkaround_complexity = SUM(Workaround_effort_per_missing_feature)\nWorkaround_effort = LOOKUP(workaround_type, {\n"No_workaround_possible": 20,\n"Complex_custom_development": 15,\n"Moderate_custom_code": 10,\n"Configuration_only": 5,\n"Manual_process_acceptable": 2\n})\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst Insurance feature analysis:\nVendor product covers 85% of requirements\nFeature_match_percentage = 85%\nCritical features missing:\n1. Prior authorization workflow automation\n2. State-specific appeals handling (50 states)\nCOUNT(missing_critical_features) = 2\nCritical_feature_gap = 2 × 15 = 30 points\nNon_critical_feature_gap = (100 - 85) / 2 = 15 / 2 = 7.5 points\nWorkaround complexity:\nFeature 1 (Prior auth):\n- workaround_type = "Moderate_custom_code" (can build adapter) → 10\nFeature 2 (State appeals):\n- workaround_type = "Complex_custom_development" (50 state variations) → 15\nWorkaround_complexity = 10 + 15 = 25 points\nFeature_Gap_Risk = 30 + 7.5 + 25 = 62.5 ≈ 63 points\n3.4.4 Data Interoperability Risk\nFormula:\nData_Interoperability_Risk = Data_format_mismatch +\nSchema_mapping_complexity +\nData_quality_issues +\nHistorical_data_migration\nData_format_mismatch = COUNT(unique_data_formats) × Format_penalty\nFormat_penalty = LOOKUP(format_type, {\n"Proprietary_binary": 12,\n"Legacy_fixed_width": 10,\n"Custom_XML": 8,\n"JSON": 3,\n"CSV": 2,\n"Standard_API": 1\n})	[-0.010554441,0.010494277,0.009545187,-0.0025069336,-0.009101128,0.020388065,0.036626935,-0.06197072,0.04522851,0.031687725,-6.634314e-05,-0.058290206,0.012489254,-0.010665127,-0.006951253,0.006003493,-0.0030691086,-