 + mainframe integration = extremely challenging\nBuilding from scratch vs. COTS: 3-4× longer timeline\n4.2.4 Model Development Risk\nFormula:\nModel_Development_Risk = Research_uncertainty +\nTraining_infrastructure +\nModel_validation_complexity +\nBias_mitigation_challenge\nResearch_uncertainty = LOOKUP(model_maturity, {\n"Production_ready_open_source": 5,\n"Research_proven_limited_deployment": 15,\n"Cutting_edge_research": 25,\n"Novel_approach_unproven": 35\n})\nTraining_infrastructure = LOOKUP(training_requirements, {\n"CPU_sufficient": 0,\n"GPU_cluster_needed": 10,\n"Multi_GPU_orchestration": 15,\n"Distributed_training_required": 20\n})\nModel_validation_complexity = LOOKUP(validation_requirements, {\n"Standard_metrics_sufficient": 5,\n"Domain_specific_validation": 10,\n"Clinical_validation_required": 20,\n"FDA_approval_pathway": 30\n})\nBias_mitigation_challenge = LOOKUP(bias_risk_level, {\n"Low (factual tasks)": 5,\n"Moderate (classification)": 10,\n"High (human judgment)": 15,\n"Critical (protected classes)": 20\n})\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst model development assessment:\nResearch uncertainty:\n- model_maturity = "Production_ready_open_source" (using GPT-4 API) → 5 points\n[NOTE: Even with API, fine-tuning for healthcare = moderate complexity]\nTraining infrastructure:\n- training_requirements = "GPU_cluster_needed" (fine-tuning on claims data) →\n10 points\nValidation:\n- validation_requirements = "Clinical_validation_required" → 20 points\n[Medical necessity decisions require clinical accuracy validation]\nBias mitigation:\n- bias_risk_level = "Critical (protected classes)" → 20 points\n[Claims decisions affect race, age, disability—protected under ADA/Civil\nRights Act]\nModel_Development_Risk = 5 + 10 + 20 + 20 = 55 points	[-0.016023993,0.052769367,0.027083881,-0.013830799,-0.017769603,0.024689784,0.039602745,-0.058121905,0.023156485,0.06657443,0.00027072238,0.08215326,0.001358931,-0.002776735,0.039301142,0.0029033928,-0.019940298,-0.017654298,