5c9d6da1-e7ec-434a-bacc-2b369d042ce6	\N	C:\\2026\\AI-Q\\Jul2026\\14July2026_bkp\\AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 2 (1).pdf	AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 2 (1).pdf	15	Bias mitigation:\n- bias_risk_level = "Critical (protected classes)" → 20 points\n[Claims decisions affect race, age, disability—protected under ADA/Civil\nRights Act]\nModel_Development_Risk = 5 + 10 + 20 + 20 = 55 points\nInterpretation: HIGH model development risk\nClinical validation + bias mitigation = 12-18 month effort\nRequires healthcare domain experts + ML researchers collaboration\n4.2.5 Infrastructure Risk\nFormula:\nInfrastructure_Risk = Cloud_platform_readiness +\nMLOps_tooling_maturity +\nMonitoring_capability +\nDisaster_recovery\nCloud_platform_readiness = LOOKUP(current_cloud_maturity, {\n"None (on-premise only)": 20,\n"Basic (lift-and-shift)": 15,\n"Intermediate (cloud-native apps)": 10,\n"Advanced (microservices, containers)": 5,\n"Expert (full cloud-native, multi-cloud)": 0\n})\nMLOps_tooling_maturity = LOOKUP(mlops_capability, {\n"None": 15,\n"Basic (manual deployment)": 10,\n"Intermediate (CI/CD for models)": 5,\n"Advanced (automated retraining)": 0\n})\nMonitoring_capability = LOOKUP(ai_monitoring_tools, {\n"None": 15,\n"Basic (logs only)": 10,\n"Intermediate (metrics + alerts)": 5,\n"Advanced (drift detection, explainability)": 0\n})\nDisaster_recovery = LOOKUP(dr_plan_for_ai, {\n"None": 10,\n"Basic (manual backup)": 6,\n"Automated (tested recovery)": 0\n})\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst infrastructure assessment:\nCloud platform:\n- current_cloud_maturity = "Intermediate" (Azure, some cloud-native) → 10\npoints\nMLOps tooling:\n- mlops_capability = "None" (no model deployment automation) → 15 points\nMonitoring:\n- ai_monitoring_tools = "None" (standard app monitoring, no AI-specific) → 15\npoints\nDisaster recovery:\n- dr_plan_for_ai = "None" (general DR exists, not AI-specific) → 10 points\nInfrastructure_Risk = 10 + 15 + 15 + 10 = 50 points\nInterpretation: HIGH infrastructure risk\nMust build MLOps platform from scratch (12+ months)\nNo AI monitoring capability (drift detection, bias monitoring)\nEstimated infrastructure buildout: $800K + 12 months\n4.2.6 Maintenance Burden Risk\nFormula:\nMaintenance_Burden_Risk = Model_retraining_frequency +\nTechnical_debt_accumulation +\nDependency_management +\nDocumentation_overhead\nModel_retraining_frequency = LOOKUP(retraining_needs, {\n"Static (annual retrain)": 5,\n"Quarterly retrain": 8,\n"Monthly retrain": 12,\n"Continuous learning": 18\n})\nTechnical_debt_accumulation = LOOKUP(team_velocity_projection, {\n"Fast (experienced team)": 5,\n"Moderate (learning curve)": 10,\n"Slow (inexperienced team)": 15\n})\nDependency_management = LOOKUP(external_dependencies, {\n"Minimal (self-contained)": 0,\n"Moderate (few libraries)": 5,\n"Heavy (many dependencies)": 10,\n"Critical (API dependencies)": 15\n})\nDocumentation_overhead = LOOKUP(regulatory_documentation_requirements, {\n"None": 0,\n"Standard": 5,\n"Healthcare (HIPAA)": 10,\n"FDA_regulated": 15\n})\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst maintenance burden:\nRetraining:\n- retraining_needs = "Monthly retrain" (claims patterns shift) → 12 points\nTechnical debt:\n- team_velocity_projection = "Slow" (inexperienced team) → 15 points\nDependencies:\n- external_dependencies = "Critical" (GPT-4 API + healthcare NLP libs) → 15\npoints\nDocumentation:\n- regulatory_documentation_requirements = "Healthcare (HIPAA)" → 10 points\nMaintenance_Burden_Risk = 12 + 15 + 15 + 10 = 52 points\nInterpretation: VERY HIGH ongoing maintenance\nMonthly retraining = 2-3 FTE dedicated to model ops\nTechnical debt from inexperienced team = future refactoring costs\nCritical API dependencies = vendor lock-in risk	[-0.025071792,0.06568075,-0.0047437907,0.010174849,0.039062954,0.012354577,0.10752529,-0.08259126,-0.019632807,0.03951769,0.0007080587,-0.0038433934,0.029063134,0.003668334,-0.026878431,-0.0126917325,0.0071472498,-0.004385