928b4754-c06f-4d07-8a50-d1cdcba55fe8	\N	C:\\2026\\AI-Q\\Jul2026\\14July2026_bkp\\AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 2 (1).pdf	AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 2 (1).pdf	19	"< 1%": 0,\n"1-5%": 5,\n"5-10%": 12,\n"10-20%": 20,\n"> 20%": 25\n})\nConsistency_issues = LOOKUP(data_standardization, {\n"Fully_standardized": 0,\n"Mostly_standardized": 6,\n"Partially_standardized": 12,\n"Not_standardized": 20\n})\nBias_in_data = LOOKUP(known_bias_assessment, {\n"Assessed_mitigated": 0,\n"Assessed_not_mitigated": 15,\n"Not_assessed": 25\n})\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst data quality assessment:\nAccuracy:\n- data_accuracy_rate = "90-95%" (some historical coding errors) → 15 points\nCompleteness:\n- missing_data_rate = "8%" (some missing fields in older claims) → 12 points\nConsistency:\n- data_standardization = "Partially_standardized"\n[Different formats from different sources, state variations]\n- Consistency_issues = 12 points\nBias:\n- known_bias_assessment = "Not_assessed" → 25 points\n[Historical claims may reflect systemic healthcare disparities]\nData_Quality_Risk = 15 + 12 + 12 + 25 = 64 points\nInterpretation: HIGH data quality risk\nMultiple quality issues across dimensions\nBias not assessed = HIGH risk of encoding discriminatory patterns\nMust perform bias audit before training (6-12 months, $500K)\nData cleaning required: 12+ months effort\n4.4.4 Data Governance Risk\nFormula:\nData_Governance_Risk = Data_Governance_Maturity_Gap_from_Assessment_Type_3 +\nData_provenance_gap +\nData_lineage_gap\nData_provenance_gap = LOOKUP(data_origin_documentation, {\n"Complete_documented": 0,\n"Partial_documented": 10,\n"Undocumented": 20\n})\nData_lineage_gap = LOOKUP(data_transformation_tracking, {\n"Automated_tracked": 0,\n"Manual_documented": 10,\n"Not_tracked": 20\n})\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst data governance assessment:\nFrom Assessment Type 3:\n- Data_Governance_Maturity_Gap = 15 points (need 1 maturity level)\nData provenance:\n- data_origin_documentation = "Partial_documented"\n[Mainframe data origin known, state feeds partially documented]\n- Data_provenance_gap = 10 points\nData lineage:\n- data_transformation_tracking = "Not_tracked"\n[No tracking of how claims data transformed across systems]\n- Data_lineage_gap = 20 points\nData_Governance_Risk = 15 + 10 + 20 = 45 points\nInterpretation: MODERATE-HIGH data governance risk\nData lineage not tracked = can't validate training data integrity\nProvenance gaps = can't verify data quality upstream\nMust establish data governance before build (6-12 months)\n4.4.5 Labeling Effort Risk\nFormula:\nLabeling_Effort_Risk = Labeling_cost +\nLabeling_expertise_requirement +\nLabeling_time_requirement\nLabeling_cost = ((Unlabeled_samples × Cost_per_label) /\nBudget_normalization_factor)\nBudget_normalization_factor = $100,000 // Normalize cost to 0-100 scale\nLabeling_expertise_requirement = LOOKUP(required_labeler_expertise, {\n"Automated (model generated)": 0,\n"Simple (any annotator)": 5,\n"Moderate (domain knowledge)": 10,\n"Expert (clinical/legal)": 20,\n"Multiple_experts_required": 25\n})\nLabeling_time_requirement = LOOKUP(estimated_labeling_duration, {\n"< 3 months": 5,\n"3-6 months": 10,\n"6-12 months": 18,\n"> 12 months": 25\n})\nCalculation Example:\nHealthFirst labeling assessment:\nLabeling cost:\n- Unlabeled_samples = 350,000 claims (have data, but not labeled for ML)\n- Cost_per_label = $5 (clinical expert review per claim)\n- Total cost = 350,000 × $5 = $1,750,000\n- Labeling_cost = $1,750,000 / $100,000 = 17.5 ≈ 18 points\nExpertise requirement:\n- required_labeler_expertise = "Expert (clinical/legal)"\n[Medical necessity labeling requires clinical judgment]\n- Expertise requirement = 20 points\nTime requirement:	[-0.031698767,0.011924609,0.017434394,-0.02572412,0.009057251,0.033459548,0.06867835,-0.0971481,0.023058275,0.051787425,0.012428149,0.020540709,0.019095788,-0.0033100492,-0.024914926,0.0038181941,-0.017941168,-0.017443605