e enterprise-scale deployments and multi-tenant architecture.", "internalOnly": false, "vendorAnswer": "Mid-market", "awardedPoints": 7, "estimatedLift": 5, "evidenceSource": "Vendor Attestation"}, {"factor": "Production Readiness", "reason": "Development stage.", "status": "weak", "category": "Operational", "deduction": 9, "maxPoints": 10, "improvement": "Move to production and build a track record with real enterprise customers.", "internalOnly": false, "vendorAnswer": "Development", "awardedPoints": 1, "estimatedLift": 9, "evidenceSource": "Vendor Attestation"}, {"factor": "Multi-tenancy & Data Isolation", "reason": "Schema-level data isolation in place.", "status": "present", "category": "Operational", "deduction": 2, "maxPoints": 8, "improvement": "Implement stronger data isolation (full instance isolation scores maximum).", "internalOnly": false, "vendorAnswer": "Schema isolation", "awardedPoints": 6, "estimatedLift": 2, "evidenceSource": "Vendor Attestation"}, {"factor": "Company Longevity", "reason": "6 years in operation — growing track record.", "status": "present", "category": "Operational", "deduction": 3, "maxPoints": 12, "improvement": "Continue building your operational history.", "internalOnly": false, "vendorAnswer": "6 years in operation", "awardedPoints": 9, "estimatedLift": 3, "evidenceSource": "Vendor Attestation"}, {"factor": "Financial Health", "reason": "Adequate financial stability demonstrated.", "status": "weak", "category": "Operational", "deduction": 5, "maxPoints": 10, "improvement": "Demonstrate financial stability through profitability or multi-year funding runway.", "internalOnly": false, "vendorAnswer": "Break-even", "awardedPoints": 5, "estimatedLift": 5, "evidenceSource": "Vendor Attestation"}, {"factor": "Customer Retention Rate", "reason": "Good customer retention rate.", "status": "weak", "category": "Operational", "deduction": 4, "maxPoints": 8, "improvement": "Report your customer retention rate. 95%+ earns maximum points.", 