ent Overview\\nObjective: Quantify an organization's readiness to implement a commercial off-the-shelf\\n(COTS) AI product from a specific vendor.\\nPrimary Users: Organizations "}, {"id": "63d6e4be-b96a-4991-b458-28da1082ebbe", "score": 0.21077659726142883, "file_name": "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 2 (1).pdf", "chunk_index": 12, "content_preview": "Change Management: 21 x 0.15 = 3.15\\nBudget Adequacy: 39 x 0.15 = 5.85\\nIntegration Risk: 51\\nTechnical Integration: 25 x 0.15 = 3.75\\nFeature Gap: 63 x 0.25 = 15.75\\nData Interoperability: 67 x 0.20 = 13.4\\nVendor Lock-in: 42 x 0.15 = 6.3\\nRollba"}, {"id": "52753de3-ada4-471c-a237-bef39db10c89", "score": 0.20118961937365687, "file_name": "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "chunk_index": 0, "content_preview": "AI EVAL Platform Risk Scoring Methodology\\nPart 1\\nTable of Contents Part 1\\nTable of Contents Part 1 1\\nOverview 4\\nMethodology Foundation 4\\nAssessment Architecture 4\\nData Foundation 4\\nMathematical Framework Overview 5\\nCore Calculation Pattern "}]}, "formula_vendor_trust_score": 92.45, "category_coverage_resolution": {"vector": {"used": true, "error": null, "pgvector_hits": {"Human Oversight Mechanisms": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.3765}, "Model Security & Integrity": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.4439}, "Post-Deployment Monitoring": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.3926}, "Incident Response & Recovery": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.4675}, "Transparency & Doc