 risk (2.6) - mitigations, domain coverage, evidence quality\\n  3. From attestation evidence, prioritize:\\n       - Complete Uptime / SLA in the attestation\\n       - Complete PII handling in the attestation\\n       - Complete Data residency in the attestation\\n       - Complete Human oversight in the attestation\\n       - Complete AI governance policy in the attestation\\n       - Complete Bias testing in the attestation\\n", "operational_risk": {"value": 16, "sla_score": {"value": 24, "uptime_points": 15, "response_time_points": 4, "resolution_time_points": 5}, "support_score": {"value": 10, "coverage_points": 5, "expertise_points": 1, "support_tier_points": 4}, "stability_score": {"value": 21, "company_age_years": 21, "company_age_points": 12, "financial_health_points": 5, "customer_retention_points": 4}, "operational_score": 84, "raw_operational_score": 84, "deployment_maturity_score": {"value": 14, "scale_points": 7, "multi_tenancy_points": 6, "production_readiness_points": 1}, "incident_management_score": {"value": 15, "plan_points": 10, "automation_points": 0, "communication_points": 5}}, "vector_retrieval": {"used": true, "error": null, "chunks": [{"id": "7fd58480-1f48-4922-a0db-9764d8cd0335", "score": 0.36548809018802175, "file_name": "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "chunk_index": 13, "content_preview": "├─ Incident Management: 30 points (automated + tested)\\n├─ Deployment Maturity: 30 points (enterprise multi-tenant)\\n├─ Stability: 22 points (8-year company, profitable)\\n├─ Support: 20 points (24/7 dedicated support)\\n├─ Operational Score: 100"}, {"id": "aa47a4b9-ef6f-4a92-a2ec-ae0bd90e7024", "score": 0.28738432676978987, "file_name": "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "chunk_index": 1, "content_preview": "supports sales enablement by estimating the difficulty of closing a specific deal via a Sales Confidence\\nScore (0–100, higher = stronger deal) that blends Customer Friction Risk (35%)