core = 10 + 5 + 5 = 20 points\\n1.4.7 Final Operational Risk\\nFormula:\\nOperational_Score = SLA + Incident_Management + Deployment_Maturity +\\nStability + Support\\nOperati"}, {"id": "aa47a4b9-ef6f-4a92-a2ec-ae0bd90e7024", "score": 0.33444255570604464, "file_name": "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "chunk_index": 1, "content_preview": "supports sales enablement by estimating the difficulty of closing a specific deal via a Sales Confidence\\nScore (0–100, higher = stronger deal) that blends Customer Friction Risk (35%), Implementation Risk\\n(35%), and Competitive Risk (30%), "}, {"id": "55e45060-ca0e-4b80-b132-88db1cfe7f4a", "score": 0.3018003640412872, "file_name": "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "chunk_index": 9, "content_preview": "\\"third_party_review\\": 15,\\n\\"internal_audit\\": 10,\\n\\"internal_review\\": 8,\\n\\"self_assessment\\": 3,\\n\\"none\\": 0\\n}) + Audit_frequency_bonus\\nAudit_frequency_bonus = IF assessmentMethod INCLUDES \\"audit\\":\\nLOOKUP(auditFrequency, {\\n\\"annual\\": 5,\\n\\"bi_annual\\""}, {"id": "3aeebc49-eb86-4850-99dd-9459b23811a9", "score": 0.29822763225703075, "file_name": "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 2 (1).pdf", "chunk_index": 1, "content_preview": "Assessment Type 3: COTS Buyer Side (Implementation Risk)\\n3.1 Assessment Overview\\nObjective: Quantify an organization's readiness to implement a commercial off-the-shelf\\n(COTS) AI product from a specific vendor.\\nPrimary Users: Organizations "}, {"id": "b195dee2-aad8-49ab-8fd2-80372a29644e", "score": 0.29735302360618043, "file_name": "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "chunk_index": 18, "content_preview": "├─ Budget: 18 ($500K-$1M + C-suite approval)\\n├─ Advantage: -36 (HIPAA+HITRUST + healthcare expertise)\\n└─ Maturity Gap: 30 (Growth vendor vs. Enterprise customer)\\nSales_Confidence_Score = 100 - [(100 × 0.35) + (100 × 0.35) + (42 × 0.30)]\\n= 1"}]}, "formula_