4. AI Safety & Testing\\n\\n- **Training Data Documentation:** Partial documentation available; full lineage, sources, and filtering criteria not disclosed\\n- **Bias Detection:** Bias testing approach not specified; no evidence of red-team exercises, third-party audits, or statistical bias monitoring\\n- **Penetration Testing:** Adversarial security testing approach not specified; frequency and scope unknown\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. AI Governance (Ethics, Oversight, and Governance)\\n\\n- **AI Ethics Policy:** No documented AI ethics or usage policy provided; safety guidelines not disclosed\\n- **Bias Audits:** No bias audit program or external evaluation mentioned; frequency unknown\\n- **Human-in-the-Loop:** No evidence of admin controls, content filtering, intervention workflows, or user override capabilities\\n- **Impact Assessment:** No system cards, model cards, or release documentation provided\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Security Posture\\n\\n- **Incident Response Plan:** Yes, documented but not tested; maturity level and testing frequency unknown\\n- **Rollback Capability:** Automated with manual trigger option; deployment rollback process in place\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. Data Practices\\n\\n- **Data Types Processed:** Marketing content (text input), user prompts, generated content outputs; PII may be embedded in customer content\\n- **PII Handling:** Not specified whether customer data containing PII is used for model training, fine-tuning, or service improvement; extent of PII processing not disclosed\\n- **Data Collection:** API and web interface; collection scope and telemetry not detailed\\n- **Data Storage:** Infrastructure provider not specified (AWS/Azure/GCP assumed but not confirmed); encryption at rest and in transit not confirmed\\n- **Data Retention:** Jasper retains customer data as long as necessary to provide services and comply with legal obligations; users can request deletion\\n- **Data Location / Residency:** No explicit data residency options specified