verview 4\\nMethodology Foundation 4\\nAssessment Architecture 4\\nData Foundation 4\\nMathematical Framework Overview 5\\nCore Calculation Pattern "}, {"id": "ab634601-dd1e-4fb2-83d7-7c2dce9988c7", "score": 0.28983402252197266, "file_name": "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 2 (1).pdf", "chunk_index": 0, "content_preview": "AI EVAL Platform Risk Scoring Methodology\\nPart 2\\nTable of Contents - Part 2\\nTable of Contents - Part 2 1\\nAssessment Type 3: COTS Buyer Side (Implementation Risk) 2\\n3.1 Assessment Overview 3\\n3.2 Vendor Risk Calculation 3\\n3.2.1 Master Formula"}]}, "formula_vendor_trust_score": 78.78, "category_coverage_resolution": {"vector": {"used": true, "error": null, "pgvector_hits": {"Human Oversight Mechanisms": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.3765}, "Model Security & Integrity": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.4439}, "Post-Deployment Monitoring": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.3926}, "Incident Response & Recovery": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.4675}, "Transparency & Documentation": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.4753}, "Testing & Auditing Procedures": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf"], "best_score": 0.4733}, "Compliance & Regulatory Adherence": {"files": ["AI EVAL Risk Scoring Technical Specification Part 1 (1).pdf", "AI E