 and payment processors not named.", "Vendor Assessment": "Not specified. No documented vendor risk assessment program or frequency."}, "title": "AI Safety & Testing", "subtitle": "Vendor Management"}, {"id": 11, "items": {"Approved": "Consumer video apps, internal team communication, developer-centric SaaS platforms, non-regulated video conferencing.", "Not Recommended": "Highly regulated deployments (e.g., medical imaging, financial transaction recording) until certifications are obtained.", "Audit Logs (SIEM Export)": "Yes, basic logging available. Audit log export capability and SIEM integration not detailed; log retention and completeness not specified.", "Usage / Interaction Telemetry": "Yes, basic metrics available. Scope limited to basic session and call metrics; detailed telemetry export or custom reporting not confirmed.", "Model / Safety Testing Results (Under NDA)": "Not specified. No indication of advanced testing results available under NDA; third-party model testing not documented.", "Supporting Testing and Policy Documentation": "Yes, basic test results available. Comprehensive security, compliance, and governance documentation not provided; policy library not disclosed.", "Conditional (Enhanced Due Diligence Required)": "Healthcare (requires HIPAA BAA and SOC 2 Type 2 audit), financial services (requires SOC 2 and GDPR DPA), government (requires FedRAMP or equivalent)."}, "title": "Evidence & Trust"}], "trustScore": {"grade": "B", "label": "Trusted Vendor", "summary": "** Daily scores in the **Moderate** range (62/100), reflecting solid operational maturity and data handling practices, but significant gaps in compliance certifications and governance documentation. The vendor demonstrates strong operational reliability (99.95% uptime SLA, annual incident response testing, automated rollback) and reasonable data practices (session-based retention, basic audit logging), which support the operations score of 75. However, the absence of security certific