t not detailed\\n- **Human Oversight:** Not specified; Artifacts feature enables user review and editing of generated content\\n- **Explainability / Transparency:** Proprietary model; transparency limited to user-facing features (Artifacts, context window visibility); no detailed model card or explainability framework documented\\n- **Update Frequency:** Not specified\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. AI Safety & Testing\\n\\n- **Training Data Documentation:** Summary only; no detailed lineage, source attribution, or composition breakdown provided\\n- **Bias Detection:** Not specified; no evidence of red-team testing, third-party bias audits, or statistical monitoring tools documented\\n- **Penetration Testing:** Not specified; no frequency or type of adversarial security testing documented\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. AI Governance (Ethics, Oversight, and Governance)\\n\\n- **AI Ethics Policy:** \\"Claude's Constitution\\" framework guides safety and ethical compliance; specific usage policies and safety guidelines not detailed in attestation\\n- **Bias Audits:** Not specified; no frequency or external evaluation schedule documented\\n- **Human-in-the-Loop:** Admin controls and content filtering not detailed; user-level review via Artifacts feature; no documented intervention workflows or escalation procedures\\n- **Impact Assessment:** Not specified; no system cards, model cards, or release impact documentation provided\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Security Posture\\n\\n- **Incident Response Plan:** Documented but not tested; maturity level unclear\\n- **Rollback Capability:** Automated with manual trigger option; deployment rollback capability confirmed\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. Data Practices\\n\\n- **Data Types Processed:** Documents, code, conversations, structured workflows, enterprise communications (via workplace connectors)\\n- **PII Handling:** Not specified; HIPAA BAA eligibility indicates PII handling capability, but extent of PII processing and safeguards not detailed\\n- **Data Collection