der (payment processing, credit card handling); OAuth providers (Google, Facebook, Apple); analytics/cookies (vendor not specified); infrastructure provider (not specified)", "Data Collection": "Web/mobile app interface (SaaS); OAuth authentication (Google, Facebook, Apple); in-app chat support; device camera access (iOS/Android with user permission)", "Data Types Processed": "User-uploaded photos/images, email addresses (via OAuth: Google, Facebook, Apple), full name, user ID, optional profile photo, transaction data (purchase history, payment amount), device and equipment data, activity logs, communications with support, IP address, browsing data", "Data Location / Residency": "Not specified. No documented option for EU data residency or customer choice of data location"}, "title": "Compliance & Certifications", "subtitle": "Data Practices"}, {"id": 8, "items": {"Certifications": "None currently. No SOC 2, ISO 27001, ISO 27018, FedRAMP, or other security certifications documented", "GDPR Compliance": "Partial. Vendor documents GDPR-aligned retention policies and consent mechanisms; DPA availability not confirmed", "HIPAA Compliance": "Not applicable (product does not process PHI; not BAA-eligible)", "EU AI Act Readiness": "Not documented", "Regulatory Frameworks": "- **NIST:** No documented alignment with NIST Cybersecurity Framework or NIST AI Risk Management Framework", "Independent Compliance Audit Method": "Not documented. No evidence of third-party security audit, SOC 2 assessment, or independent compliance review", "Audit Frequency / Last Audit Date / Audit Findings": "No third-party audit documented; internal incident response plan tested annually (no external audit findings available)"}, "title": "Operations & Support", "subtitle": "Compliance & Certifications"}, {"id": 9, "items": {"Uptime SLA": "99.9% (8.8 hours downtime per year); contractual commitment level not specified", "Change Management / Release Cadence": "Not documented. No release process, rol